<span class=3D"mord mtight">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></sp=
an></span><span class=3D"mclose">)</span></span></span></span>, where <span=
 class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.=
org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encodin=
g=3D"application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=
